msgid "Triton-Ascend 性能分析方法"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend Performance Analysis Methods"

msgid "获取性能数据"
msgstr "Collect performance data"

msgid "在进行性能优化之前，需要获取准确的性能数据，了解性能现状，并根据性能现状分析下一步的优化方向。MindStudio提供了多种针对Triton算子性能测试方法，包括上板Profiling、单算子性能仿真流水图等手段。"
msgstr "Before optimizing performance, obtain accurate performance data, understand the current performance status, and analyze the next optimization direction based on this status. MindStudio provides multiple performance testing methods for Triton operators, including on-board Profiling and single-operator performance simulation pipeline diagrams."

msgid "上板Profiling"
msgstr "On-Board Profiling"

msgid "msProf工具用于采集和分析运行在昇腾AI处理器上算子的关键性能指标，用户可根据输出的性能数据，快速定位算子的软、硬件性能瓶颈，提升算子性能的分析效率。"
msgstr "The msProf tool collects and analyzes the key performance metrics of operators running on the Ascend AI processor. You can use the output performance data to quickly locate software and hardware performance bottlenecks, improving the efficiency of operator performance analysis."

msgid "注： msProf工具的使用依赖CANN包中的msopprof可执行文件，该文件中的接口功能和msprof op一致，该文件为CANN包自带，无需单独安装，msProf工具常用命令请参考[msProf常用命令](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/mindstudio/82RC1/ODtools/Operatordevelopmenttools/atlasopdev_16_0082.html)。"
msgstr "Note: The msProf tool depends on the msopprof executable file in the CANN package. The interface functions in this file are consistent with those of msprof op. This file is included in the CANN package and does not need to be installed separately. For common commands of the msProf tool, refer to [Common msProf Commands](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/mindstudio/82RC1/ODtools/Operatordevelopmenttools/atlasopdev_16_0082.html)."

msgid "如下命令行是一个算子上板性能数据采集的示例，可以根据自身的需要灵活组合配置参数。示例中 --output为可选参数，用于指定收集到的性能数据的存放路径；--kernel-name为可选参数，用于指定需要收集的单个kernel的性能数据（如果不指定，则只对程序运行过程中调度的第一个算子进行采集）；$HOME/projects/test_op.py为算子可执行脚本。"
msgstr "The following command line is an example of on-board performance data collection for an operator. You can flexibly combine configuration parameters according to your needs. In the example, --output is an optional parameter that specifies the storage path for the collected performance data. --kernel-name is an optional parameter that specifies the performance data of a single kernel to be collected. If you do not specify this parameter, only the first operator scheduled during program execution is collected. $HOME/projects/test_op.py is the operator executable script."

msgid ""
"msprof op --kernel-name=target_kernel_name --output=$HOME/projects/output python3 $HOME/projects/test_op.py\n"
msgstr ""
"msprof op --kernel-name=target_kernel_name --output=$HOME/projects/output python3 $HOME/projects/test_op.py\n"

msgid "以示范测试用例[03-layer-norm.py](../../../third_party/ascend/unittest/autotune_ut/03-layer-norm.py)为例(不指定--output时生成的数据文件保存在当前路径下)："
msgstr "Take the sample test case [03-layer-norm.py](../../../third_party/ascend/unittest/autotune_ut/03-layer-norm.py) as an example (when --output is not specified, the generated data files are saved in the current path):"

msgid ""
"msprof op --kernel-name=_layer_norm_fwd_fused python3 03-layer-norm.py\n"
msgstr ""
"msprof op --kernel-name=_layer_norm_fwd_fused python3 03-layer-norm.py\n"

msgid "注：以下所有采集项的结果数据含义可参考《CANN 性能调优工具用户指南》中的[op_summary（算子详细信息）](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/83RC1/devaids/Profiling/atlasprofiling_16_0067.html)章节。 **图1** PipeUtilization.csv（计算单元和搬运单元耗时占比）文件示例 ![alt text](../figures/time_consumed.png)"
msgstr "Note: For the meaning of the result data of the following collection items, refer to the [op_summary (Operator Details)](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/83RC1/devaids/Profiling/atlasprofiling_16_0067.html) chapter in the CANN Performance Tuning Tool User Guide. **Figure 1** Example of the PipeUtilization.csv file (time consumption percentage of compute units and data movement units) ![alt text](../figures/time_consumed.png)"

