msgid "算子仿真流水图"
msgstr "Operator simulation pipeline diagram"

msgid "算子调优工具 msProf 支持仿真环境下的性能数据采集和自动解析。使用msProf工具获取仿真流水图的具体方式请参考[指令流水图](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/83RC1/devaids/optool/atlasopdev_16_0087.html)。 生成算子仿真流水图的命令与算子上板性能数据采集的命令类似。同样以上述```03-layer-norm.py```为例，```--soc-version```用于指定当前机器的硬件版本，可在终端中输入```npu-smi info```查看："
msgstr "The operator tuning tool msProf supports performance data collection and automatic parsing in a simulation environment. For details about how to use the msProf tool to obtain the simulation pipeline diagram, refer to [Instruction Pipeline Diagram](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/83RC1/devaids/optool/atlasopdev_16_0087.html). The command for generating the operator simulation pipeline diagram is similar to the command for collecting on-board operator performance data. Using the preceding ```03-layer-norm.py``` as an example again, ```--soc-version``` specifies the hardware version of the current machine. You can run ```npu-smi info``` in the terminal to check the version:"

msgid ""
"# source simulator路径\n"
"export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$HOME/CANN/Install_CANN/Ascend/ascend_toolkit/latest/tools/simulator/{soc-version}/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH\n"
"# 执行算子仿真流水图采集\n"
"msprof op simulator --kernel-name=_layer_norm_fwd_fused --soc-version={soc-version} python3 03-layer-norm.py\n"
msgstr ""
"# Source simulator path\n"
"export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$HOME/CANN/Install_CANN/Ascend/ascend_toolkit/latest/tools/simulator/{soc-version}/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH\n"
"# Collect the operator simulation pipeline\n"
"msprof op simulator --kernel-name=_layer_norm_fwd_fused --soc-version={soc-version} python3 03-layer-norm.py\n"

msgid "注：上述示例 `soc-version=Ascend910B3`。下面列表基于cann 9.2.0 版本整理输出。"
