msgid "以下两个文件中保存了获取的性能数据："
msgstr "The following two files store the collected performance data:"

msgid "trace.json"
msgstr "trace.json"

msgid "visualize_data.bin"
msgstr "visualize_data.bin"

msgid "trace.json 支持以下两种可视化呈现方式："
msgstr "trace.json supports the following two visualization methods:"

msgid "Chrome浏览器 在Chrome浏览器中输入 ```chrome://tracing``` 地址，并将通过msprof op simulator 生成指令流水图文件（trace.json）拖到空白处打开，键盘上输入快捷键（W：放大；S：缩小；A：左移；D：右移）可进行查看。 **图2** Chrome浏览器时间线界面 ![alt text](../figures/trace_json_with_chrome.png)"
msgstr "Chrome Browser Enter the ```chrome://tracing``` address in the Chrome browser. Drag the instruction pipeline diagram file (trace.json) generated by msprof op simulator to the blank area to open it. Use keyboard shortcuts (W: zoom in; S: zoom out; A: move left; D: move right) to view the diagram. **Figure 2** Chrome browser timeline interface ![alt text](../figures/trace_json_with_chrome.png)"

msgid ".. image:: ../figures/trace_json_with_chrome.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../figures/trace_json_with_chrome.png"

msgid "[MindStudio Insight](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/mindstudio/82RC1/GUI_baseddevelopmenttool/msascendinsightug/Insight_userguide_0005.html)可视化呈现 MindStudio Insight工具以时序图方式为用户提供指令在昇腾AI处理器上的运行情况，用户可通过分析时序图中的指令详情、指令执行时间、指令关联代码的调用栈及指令/流水间同步连线等信息，识别微观指令的时序优化点。 **图3** MindStudio Insight时间线界面 ![alt text](../figures/trace_json_with_insight.png)"
msgstr "[MindStudio Insight](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/mindstudio/82RC1/GUI_baseddevelopmenttool/msascendinsightug/Insight_userguide_0005.html) visualized presentation The MindStudio Insight tool provides the execution status of instructions on the Ascend AI processor by using a timeline diagram. By analyzing information in the timeline diagram, such as instruction details, instruction execution time, call stacks of code associated with instructions, and synchronization lines between instructions and pipelines, you can identify timing optimization points for micro-instructions. **Figure 3** MindStudio Insight timeline interface ![alt text](../figures/trace_json_with_insight.png)"

msgid ".. image:: ../figures/trace_json_with_insight.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../figures/trace_json_with_insight.png"

msgid "visualize_data.bin支持在MindStudio Insight可视化呈现："
msgstr "visualize_data.bin supports visualization in MindStudio Insight:"

msgid "除了与trace.json一样可以采集到性能数据之外，visualize_data.bin还提供了与源代码（如：03-layer-norm.py）对应的指令关联看板。 **图4** MindStudio Insight-visualize_data.bin指令关联"
msgstr "In addition to collecting performance data like trace.json, visualize_data.bin also provides an instruction association dashboard corresponding to the source code (for example, 03-layer-norm.py). **Figure 4** MindStudio Insight-visualize_data.bin instruction association"

msgid "注：以下采集项的结果数据含义可参考《MindStudio Insight 工具》的[算子调优](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/mindstudio/82RC1/GUI_baseddevelopmenttool/msascendinsightug/Insight_userguide_0068.html)章节。 ![alt text](../figures/visualize_data_with_insight.png)"
msgstr "Note: For the meaning of the result data of the following collection items, refer to the [Operator Tuning](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/mindstudio/82RC1/GUI_baseddevelopmenttool/msascendinsightug/Insight_userguide_0068.html) chapter in the *MindStudio Insight Tool* document. ![alt text](../figures/visualize_data_with_insight.png)"

msgid ".. image:: ../figures/visualize_data_with_insight.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../figures/visualize_data_with_insight.png"

msgid "仿真流水图采集Triton算子Debug版本"
msgstr "Collecting simulation pipeline graphs for the Triton operator debug version"

msgid "仿真流水图（trace.json / visualize_data.bin）默认只包含指令地址与指令名。若希望在MindStudio Insight中使用指令关联看板、查看指令对应的Triton/Python源码行与调用栈（即[查找瓶颈](#locating-bottlenecks)中的方法四），需要将算子编译为带debug_line调试信息的版本。未开启时，msprof op simulator会输出如下提示，且代码关联文件为空："
msgstr "The simulation timeline (trace.json / visualize_data.bin) contains only instruction addresses and instruction names by default. To use the instruction association dashboard in MindStudio Insight and view the Triton/Python source code lines and call stacks corresponding to the instructions (that is, Method 4 in [Locating Bottlenecks](#locating-bottlenecks)), you need to compile the operator with debug_line debug information. When this is not enabled, msprof op simulator outputs the following message, and the code association file is empty:"

msgid ""
"[WARN] Kernel missed debug_line information. If you need code call stack, please recompile kernel with -g option\n"
"[WARN] Code call stack is empty\n"
"[WARN] Lack of code info of files\n"
msgstr ""
"[WARN] Kernel missed debug_line information. If you need code call stack, please recompile kernel with -g option\n"
"[WARN] Code call stack is empty\n"
"[WARN] Lack of code info of files\n"

msgid "Triton算子无需手动添加`-g`，triton-ascend后端通过环境变量`TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO`控制是否在`bishengir-compile`命令中追加`--enable-debug-info=true`。注意triton-ascend默认值为`true`（即默认**关闭**行号信息，与社区Triton默认开启相反），需显式置为`False`："
msgstr "You do not need to manually add `-g` for Triton operators. The triton-ascend backend controls whether to append `--enable-debug-info=true` to the `bishengir-compile` command through the environment variable `TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO`. Note that the default value in triton-ascend is `true` (that is, line number information is **disabled** by default, which is the opposite of the community Triton default). You must explicitly set it to `False`:"

msgid ""
"export TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO=0\n"
msgstr ""
"export TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO=0\n"

msgid "验证是否生效：日志中`[DEBUG] cmd_list:`一行应包含`--enable-debug-info=true`，且`Kernel missed debug_line information`告警消失。随后将`visualize_data.bin`导入MindStudio Insight，即可在指令时序图中查看每条指令关联的源码行与调用栈。"
msgstr "To verify that it takes effect, check that the `[DEBUG] cmd_list:` line in the log contains `--enable-debug-info=true`. The `Kernel missed debug_line information` warning should disappear. Then import `visualize_data.bin` into MindStudio Insight. You can view the source code line and call stack associated with each instruction in the instruction timing diagram."

msgid "分析性能数据"
msgstr "Analyze performance data"

msgid "<a id=\"theoretical-parameters\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"theoretical-parameters\"></a>"

msgid "<a id=\"theoretical-parameters\">"
msgstr "<a id=\"theoretical-parameters\">"

msgid "理论参数"
msgstr "Theoretical parameters"

msgid "理论性能为算子实际性能的理想目标。不同的硬件平台的硬件规格各异，理论性能可以帮助我们了解硬件的潜能，从而设定性能优化的目标。"
msgstr "Theoretical performance is the ideal target for the actual performance of an operator. Different hardware platforms have varying hardware specifications. Theoretical performance helps you understand the potential of the hardware and set the target for performance tuning."

msgid "搬运相关流水（MTE1/MTE2/MTE3等）的理论耗时 = 搬运数据量（单位：Byte）/ 理论带宽。例如：某款AI处理器的GM峰值带宽约为1.8TB/s，想要进行一次float数据类型、4096 * 4096大小的矩阵搬运，搬运的理论耗时是`sizeof(float) * 4096 * 4096 / 1.8 TB/s = 37.28 μs`（按照1 TB = 10^12 Byte来计算）。"
msgstr "The theoretical time of data movement-related pipelines (MTE1/MTE2/MTE3 and so on) = the amount of data to move (in bytes) / the theoretical bandwidth. For example, the GM peak bandwidth of a certain AI processor is approximately 1.8 TB/s. To perform a matrix data movement of the float data type with a size of 4096 * 4096, the theoretical time of the data movement is `sizeof(float) * 4096 * 4096 / 1.8 TB/s = 37.28 μs` (calculated based on 1 TB = 10^12 Byte)."

msgid "说明:"
msgstr "Description:"

msgid "搬运指令同时存在时，会存在共享带宽的情况，并不能每条都以接近理论带宽的速率搬运数据。比如，当MTE2/MTE3同时进行GM读写时，搬运流水线的耗时应该是（MTE2搬运量 + MTE3搬运量）/ GM带宽。"
msgstr "When data movement instructions run simultaneously, they share the bandwidth. Therefore, no single instruction can move data at a rate close to the theoretical bandwidth. For example, when MTE2 and MTE3 read from and write to the GM simultaneously, the data movement pipeline latency should be (MTE2 data volume + MTE3 data volume) / GM bandwidth."

msgid "搬运不同大小的数据块时，对带宽的利用率（有效带宽/理论带宽）不一样。针对每次搬运数据量较小的情况，实测性能达不到理论带宽。"
msgstr "When moving data blocks of different sizes, the bandwidth utilization (effective bandwidth/theoretical bandwidth) varies. When the amount of data moved each time is small, the measured performance cannot reach the theoretical bandwidth."

msgid "计算相关流水（Cube/Vector/Scalar等）的理论耗时 = 计算数据量（单位：Element） / 理论算力。例如：某款AI处理器对float数据类型的Vector理论峰值算力为11.06 TOPS，想要进行一次32k float类型的Element单指令计算，计算的理论耗时是32k / 11.06TOPS = 3ns（按照1k = 1000来计算）。"
msgstr "The theoretical execution time of computation pipelines (Cube/Vector/Scalar, and so on) = computation data volume (unit: Element) / theoretical computing power. For example, the theoretical peak Vector computing power of an AI processor for the float data type is 11.06 TOPS. To perform a single-instruction computation on 32k float Elements, the theoretical execution time is 32k / 11.06TOPS = 3ns (calculated based on 1k = 1000)."

msgid "<a id=\"locating-bottlenecks\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"locating-bottlenecks\"></a>"

msgid "<a id=\"locating-bottlenecks\">"
msgstr "<a id=\"locating-bottlenecks\">"

msgid "查找瓶颈"
msgstr "Identify bottlenecks"

msgid "获取性能数据后，和理论数值差异较大的地方、耗时较长的流程被认为是“瓶颈点”。下文将介绍如何通过性能数据找到瓶颈点和对应的优化方向。"
msgstr "After you obtain the performance data, areas with significant differences from theoretical values and time-consuming processes are considered bottleneck points. The following section describes how to identify bottleneck points and the corresponding optimization directions using the performance data."

msgid "方法一：通过上板Profiling分析流水情况 查看上板Profiling解析后的op_summary_\\*.csv文件分析流水情况。注：“\\*”表示时间戳。 ![analyse_data_op_summary](../figures/performance_analysis_analyse_data_op_summary.png)"
msgstr "Method 1: Analyze the pipeline status through on-board Profiling View the op_summary_\\*.csv file parsed from on-board Profiling to analyze the pipeline status. Note: \"\\*\" indicates a timestamp. ![analyse_data_op_summary](../figures/performance_analysis_analyse_data_op_summary.png)"

